-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Adaptogenic Blends</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ashwagandha, rhodiola, and traditional adaptogens for stress response and daily energy.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Ashwagandha</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Rhodiola</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Adaptogens</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">IMMUNE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Immune Botanicals</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Echinacea, elderberry, and traditional immune-support botanicals.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Echinacea</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Elderberry</span></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609500,"order":5,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Private%20Label/Images/High-Quality_Ingredientss.jpg\" alt=\"Herbal supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR HERBAL</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Premium botanicals, doctor-formulated, scientifically backed.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">Identifying premium herbal ingredients requires extensive sourcing networks, labs, and tools the average business owner does not have. We have done the legwork: ingredients pass internal and third-party testing for purity, efficacy, and safety. Doctor-formulated products built on current research, never adulterated with needless fillers.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216201609501,"order":6,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 70px 20px 0; text-align: center;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<p style=\"color: #6ba644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">OUR PRIVATE LABEL CATEGORIES</p>\n<h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Browse all 17 private label wellness categories</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\"><span style=\"color: #555555; text-align: center; background-color: #f7f7f6;\">Most brands start with one category and expand. Combine your herbal skis with adjacent categories to grow lifetime value per customer.</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; padding: 0 20px 80px;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px;\" class=\"pl-cat-grid\"><a href=\"/pl-demo-fitness\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png\" alt=\"Fitness\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\">\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Fitness</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a><a href=\"/pl-demo-herbal\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08); text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png\" alt=\"Herbal\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"padding: 14px 20px 20px;\">\n<p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0;\">Herbal</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a><a href=\"/pl-demo-aging\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n<div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px